# Cargo build output. The crate source is committed; compiled artifacts are not.
#
# A .node binary in git is a bad trade: it is rebuilt for every platform/arch, it goes stale
# on every Electron bump, and it cannot be reviewed in a diff. Rebuild with `npm run cu:build`
# from desktop/ (needs a Rust toolchain; not required to run the rest of the app — the
# injection tools degrade to a clear "module not built" message without it).
target/

# The built Node-API addon, copied out of target/release by the cu:build script.
*.node
*.dll
*.dll.lib